{"game": "aliens-fireteam-elite", "language": "english", "appid": 1549970, "month": "2025-07", "window": 2, "start_date": 1751932800, "end_date": 1752623999, "month_true_total": 105, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-04 02:25:13 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "199875833", "author": {"steamid": "76561198040419213", "personaname": "Agent P", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198040419213/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 96, "playtime_forever": 2809, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2131, "last_played": 1775227832, "avatar": "b41610e0a235e45c0174ab806db2e0d57225217f"}, "language": "english", "review": "THE BEST ALIENS EXPERIENCE: \n\n This game was intended to play as a coop online.\n If you dont have your own mates-team, you may find some random players online...\n Sometimes its great. Sometimes they lag and game becomes un-playable. \n BUT, you can always replace the humans with 2 AI bots\n So you can enjoy (what I guess is) THE BEST ALIENS EXPERIENCE ever. \n Also, I guess the BEST ALINE'S WEAPONS collection ever made.\n including flamers, rocket launchers, shotguns, pistols, asault rifles, machine-guns, sniper rifles, sentry guns, mines, etc. etc. etc. \n Great maps filled with ambushes in beauty art-worked scenarios.\n And wide range of beaty nasty creatures\n I love to see waves of aliens coming from the roof and falling  down in flames\n\n CONS: final battles are pretty hard if you play with bots.\n Some mini-bosses are way to OP \n Its harder if you dont have a full equiped vet human on your side.\n And its not that easy to have one of them plus a good internet conection \n\n  Great vissuals, great Sound, great game, great weaponry, great bestiary, great Aliens movie experience 7/10", "timestamp_created": 1752602081, "timestamp_updated": 1754085542, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 6, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.522866308689117432",